1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,528
Kaan tahtada ders anlatıyor, peki Kaan

2
00:00:03,528 --> 00:00:04,571
öğretmen mi?

3
00:00:05,021 --> 00:00:06,952
He talks like a teacher.

4
00:00:07,252 --> 00:00:10,733
Like, gibi demek; Kaan öğretmen değil,

5
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:13,053
sadece öğretmen gibi konuşuyor.

6
00:00:13,553 --> 00:00:16,570
İşte Selin Hoca geldi, o gerçekten

7
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:17,073
öğretmen.

8
00:00:17,573 --> 00:00:19,614
As a teacher, I see this

9
00:00:19,614 --> 00:00:20,294
every day.

10
00:00:20,594 --> 00:00:23,068
As ve ardından bir isim, olarak

11
00:00:23,068 --> 00:00:25,542
ya da sıfatıyla demek, yani gerçek

12
00:00:25,542 --> 00:00:25,954
rol.

13
00:00:26,554 --> 00:00:29,435
As a child, I loved drawing.

14
00:00:29,735 --> 00:00:33,626
Yani as a child, çocukken demek.

15
00:00:34,126 --> 00:00:36,646
Stop acting like a child!

16
00:00:36,946 --> 00:00:39,655
Like a child ise çocuk gibi

17
00:00:39,655 --> 00:00:40,107
demek.

18
00:00:40,707 --> 00:00:44,147
Arkasından tam bir cümle geliyorsa, resmî

19
00:00:44,147 --> 00:00:45,867
dilde as kullanılır.

20
00:00:46,367 --> 00:00:48,207
Do as I say.

21
00:00:48,707 --> 00:00:52,023
Sıra sende, hemşire olarak çalışıyorsa as

22
00:00:52,023 --> 00:00:54,787
mı, like mı, yorumlara yaz!
